---
/** Automated Inquiry — a message becomes a brief. */
---
<div class="mk-panel wide">
  <div class="mk-head"><b>New inquiry</b><small>Email · 09:14</small></div>
  <div class="mk-msg sys"><p>"Two of us, Kenya, early March, 9 nights, Mara. Mid-range."</p></div>
  <div class="mk-row2">
    <div class="mk-field"><label>Where</label><div contenteditable="true" spellcheck="false">Kenya · Mara</div></div>
    <div class="mk-field"><label>When</label><div contenteditable="true" spellcheck="false">3 – 12 March</div></div>
    <div class="mk-field"><label>Who</label><div contenteditable="true" spellcheck="false">2 adults</div></div>
    <div class="mk-field" data-live="ask" data-answer="€4,000 – 4,500 pp" data-then=".js-confirm" data-then-small="Lena said yes · Planning"><label>Budget</label><div class="ph focus">Asked · click for the reply</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="mk-row plain js-confirm" style="border-bottom:0"><div><b>Confirm with the traveller</b><small>Sent to Lena</small></div><span class="mk-chk wait"></span></div>
</div>
